<title>FRANCE: Lyonnaise to announce results Thursday.</title>
<headline>Lyonnaise to announce results Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Utilities group Lyonnaise des Eaux will announce its 1996 results on Thursday morning, a company spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The Lyonnaise board was due to meet at 1300 GMT on Wednesday to approve the 1996 accounts, she said.</p>
<p>She said there would be no statement immediately after the board meeting, which is expected to discuss plans for a merger with holding company Cie de Suez.</p>
<p>The Suez board on Tuesday unanimously backed the merger in principle. Detailed merger plans are due to be discussed at special board meetings of the two companies on April 11.</p>
</text>
